title: Campaign Between Elections
subtitle: Spend one resource to organise inside a national voter bloc.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 200
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_campaigning_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_campaigning_timer = 2
card-image: img/poland/cards/campaigning.webp

= Campaign Between Elections

Every party is already contesting the same country. Choose where organisers,
mail, visits and local candidates should concentrate before the next poll.

- @metropolitan
- @professionals
- @public_services
- @industrial
- @provincial
- @rural
- @older
- @youth
- @skip

@metropolitan
title: Metropolitan liberal voters
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Strong equality reach, direct competition with KO.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; metropolitan_liberals_left_affinity += 4; women_support += 1; urban_progressive_support += 2; ko_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica contests the metropolitan liberal electorate"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@professionals
title: Liberal professionals
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Credibility and competence matter more than slogans.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 4; public_trust += 2; media_capacity += 1; ko_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Policy teams campaign among liberal professionals"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@public_services
title: Public-service families
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Teachers, nurses and care workers become the field plan.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; public_service_families_left_affinity += 5; public_sector_support += 3; labor_credibility += 1; news_headline = "Public-service workplaces become a campaign network"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@industrial
title: Industrial and logistics workers
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Rebuild a constituency now dominated by PiS.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 5; workers_support += 3; labor_credibility += 1; pis_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Organisers return to industrial and logistics workplaces"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@provincial
title: Provincial welfare voters
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Social guarantees need recognisable local messengers.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; provincial_welfare_left_affinity += 5; workers_support += 1; local_network += 2; household_policy_pressure += 1; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Election campaign"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica campaigns beyond the largest cities"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@rural
title: Rural localists
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A difficult incursion into PSL and PiS terrain.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_localists_left_affinity += 5; rural_support += 3; local_network += 2; psl_relation -= 2; news_headline = "The red campaign reaches county and rural networks"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@older
title: Older welfare households
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Material security, health and a patient doorstep campaign.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; older_welfare_households_left_affinity += 5; pensioner_support += 3; health_policy_pressure += 1; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Election campaign"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica asks older voters to hear a social offer outside PiS"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@youth
title: Anti-establishment youth
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Compete with Konfederacja without imitating it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5; young_support += 3; turnout_readiness += 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.1; news_headline = "Young organisers contest the anti-system electorate"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@skip
title: Save the money
subtitle: The campaign remains national only on paper.
on-arrival: turnout_readiness -= 1; news_headline = "No voter bloc receives a sustained field campaign"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish
